== Tips ==
*{{Item|Snow Suit Armor|text=Snow Suit}} (including equipment) and {{Item|Nutcracker Armor}}, {{Item|Reindeer Pet}}, {{Item|Hideongift Shard}}, the Season of Joy perk from [[Ice Essence Shop]] and the Present Connoisseur perk from {{NPCSprite|Doug}} grant more '''Gifts''' from the [[Season of Jerry]] event.

== Trivia ==
*Sometimes, when a player opens another player's Gift, the player who placed the gift received both items. This usually occurs when a lot of gifts is placed on the same spot.
*The current Bazaar instant buy price of a White Gift is {{BZC|1 White Gift}}. White Gifts drop on average {{c|2082}}, or {{c|4164}} when counting the rewards for both players, such as in a [[Co-op]]. They also drop on average {{North Stars|0.1}} and other rewards, but the coin values of these rewards varies.

